timestamp=2026-09-07T02:22:35.277Z level=INFO run=ac30bf05 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\nimport math, cmath\n\ndef dft(x):\n    n = len(x)\n    half = n // 2 + 1\n    out = []\n    for k in range(half):\n        val = sum(x[t] * cmath.exp(-2j * math.pi * k * t / n) for t in range(n))\n        out.append(abs(val))\n    return out\n\nsig = [math.sin(2 * math.pi * 5 * i / 200) for i in range(200)]\nmags = dft(sig)\nfreqs = [k * 200 / 200 for k in range(len(mags))]\ndom_idx = max(range(1, len(mags)), key=lambda k: mags[k])\nprint(\"Dominant freq:\", freqs[dom_idx], \"Hz (expected 5.0 Hz)\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
